#: transparent-edge-cache.php:240
msgid "Transparent Edge Cache — cache fragmentation fixed"
msgstr "Transparent Edge Cache — fragmentación de caché corregida"

#: transparent-edge-cache.php:241
msgid "This update turned off Vary: X-Device and Vary: Accept-Language, which were splitting your edge cache into extra copies without serving different content (they were hurting your hit ratio). If your site genuinely serves different HTML for the same URL per device or per browser language, you can switch them back on under TE Cache → Cache."
msgstr "Esta actualización ha desactivado Vary: X-Device y Vary: Accept-Language, que dividían tu caché de edge en copias extra sin servir contenido distinto (perjudicaban tu hit ratio). Si tu sitio sirve HTML distinto para la misma URL por dispositivo o por idioma del navegador, puedes volver a activarlos en TE Cache → Caché."

#: transparent-edge-cache.php:257
msgid "Every 30 minutes (Transparent Edge)"
msgstr "Cada 30 minutos (Transparent Edge)"

#: transparent-edge-cache.php:378
msgid "Transparent Edge Cache — Write permissions required"
msgstr "Transparent Edge Cache — Permisos de escritura necesarios"

#: transparent-edge-cache.php:379
msgid "The following directories are not writable. CSS/JS combine and Google Fonts self-hosting will not work until this is resolved:"
msgstr "Los siguientes directorios no tienen permisos de escritura. El combinado de CSS/JS y el auto-alojamiento de Google Fonts no funcionarán hasta que se resuelva:"

#: transparent-edge-cache.php:381
msgid "After fixing permissions, deactivate and reactivate the plugin to dismiss this notice."
msgstr "Después de corregir los permisos, desactiva y reactiva el plugin para ocultar este aviso."

