#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:344
msgid "Enable Cache Headers"
msgstr "Activar Cabeceras de Caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:345
msgid "Send Cache-Control, Surrogate-Keys, and Vary headers"
msgstr "Enviar cabeceras Cache-Control, Surrogate-Keys y Vary"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:349
msgid "Dynamic Content (HTML)"
msgstr "Contenido Dinámico (HTML)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:353
msgid "Pages, posts, archives, REST API — generated by PHP. These headers are sent by the plugin directly."
msgstr "Páginas, posts, archivos, REST API — generados por PHP. Estas cabeceras se envían directamente desde el plugin."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:357 includes/admin/views/main-page.php:389 includes/admin/views/main-page.php:498
msgid "CDN TTL (s-maxage)"
msgstr "TTL CDN (s-maxage)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:360
msgid "seconds. Default: 172800 (48h). How long Varnish keeps HTML pages."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 172800 (48h). Cuánto tiempo Varnish mantiene las páginas HTML."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:364 includes/admin/views/main-page.php:396 includes/admin/views/main-page.php:505
msgid "Browser TTL (max-age)"
msgstr "TTL Navegador (max-age)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:367
msgid "seconds. Default: 3600 (1h). Reduces unnecessary checks to CDN nodes."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 3600 (1h). Reduce chequeos innecesarios a nodos CDN."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:372
msgid "Homepage (front page)"
msgstr "Portada (página de inicio)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:376
msgid "The homepage is the most-requested URL and the one that must never fall back to the origin. Give it its own policy — a short fresh window plus a generous stale-while-revalidate — so an expiry is served stale instantly while a single request revalidates behind it, instead of a miss storm. When off, the homepage uses the global HTML profile above."
msgstr "La portada es la URL más solicitada y la que nunca debe caer al origen. Dale su propia política —una ventana de frescura corta más un stale-while-revalidate generoso— para que, al expirar, se sirva stale al instante mientras una sola petición revalida por detrás, en lugar de una tormenta de miss. Si está desactivado, la portada usa el perfil HTML global de arriba."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:380
msgid "Dedicated homepage profile"
msgstr "Perfil dedicado de portada"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:384
msgid "Use these values for the homepage instead of the global HTML TTLs"
msgstr "Usar estos valores para la portada en lugar de los TTL HTML globales"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:392
msgid "seconds. Default: 300 (5 min). Short fresh window for a news homepage."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 300 (5 min). Ventana de frescura corta para una portada de noticias."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:399
msgid "seconds. Default: 30. Low so breaking news is picked up quickly."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 30. Bajo para recoger rápido la última hora."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:403
msgid "Stale-while-revalidate"
msgstr "Stale-while-revalidate"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:406
msgid "seconds. Default: 300. After expiry the edge serves the stale homepage instantly and a single request revalidates behind it — this is what shields a weak origin."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 300. Tras expirar, el edge sirve la portada stale al instante y una sola petición revalida por detrás — esto es lo que protege a un origen débil."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:410
msgid "Stale-if-error"
msgstr "Stale-if-error"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:413
msgid "seconds. Default: 86400 (24h). Airbag: if the origin returns 5xx, serve the last good homepage instead of an error."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 86400 (24h). Airbag: si el origen devuelve 5xx, sirve la última portada buena en lugar de un error."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:420
msgid "Serve-stale VCL (grace / keep) — propose-only, makes stale-while-revalidate actually work"
msgstr "VCL de servir-stale (grace / keep) — solo propuesta, hace que stale-while-revalidate funcione de verdad"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:421
msgid "The homepage profile sends stale-while-revalidate and stale-if-error, but Varnish only serves stale during revalidation when grace/keep match. This snippet derives them from the Cache-Control the plugin sends, so they stay in sync. The plugin never deploys VCL — copy it into Configuration → VCL."
msgstr "El perfil de portada envía stale-while-revalidate y stale-if-error, pero Varnish solo sirve stale durante la revalidación si grace/keep coinciden. Este snippet los deriva del Cache-Control que envía el plugin, para que se mantengan sincronizados. El plugin nunca despliega VCL — cópialo en Configuration → VCL."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:423 includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1018 includes/admin/views/tab-security.php:130 includes/admin/views/tab-speculation.php:133
msgid "Copy VCL"
msgstr "Copiar VCL"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:430
msgid "Origin page cache (serves HTML before WordPress boots)"
msgstr "Page cache de origen (sirve HTML antes de que arranque WordPress)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:434
msgid "On a CDN miss the edge still has to fetch from the origin. This serves a pre-rendered copy of anonymous pages before WordPress boots, so that fetch does not regenerate WordPress. Enable/disable it from the Page Cache card at the top. Logged-in users, and any URL or cookie in your exclusions, are never page-cached."
msgstr "Ante un miss de CDN, el edge sigue teniendo que ir al origen. Esto sirve una copia pre-renderizada de las páginas anónimas antes de que arranque WordPress, de modo que ese fetch no regenera WordPress. Actívala o desactívala desde la tarjeta Page Cache de arriba. Los usuarios logados, y cualquier URL o cookie de tus exclusiones, nunca se cachean en página."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:438
msgid "Storage backend"
msgstr "Backend de almacenamiento"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:443
msgid "Disk (default)"
msgstr "Disco (por defecto)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:444
msgid "Zero dependencies, works anywhere. Each lookup is a filesystem read, so on slow or network disk (NFS) and under very high concurrency the I/O and stat cost shows, and lookups index slower than an in-memory store."
msgstr "Cero dependencias, funciona en cualquier sitio. Cada lectura es un acceso a disco, así que en discos lentos o de red (NFS) y con mucha concurrencia se nota el coste de E/S y de stat, y el indexado es más lento que en un almacén en memoria."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:448
msgid "Redis"
msgstr "Redis"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:449 includes/admin/views/main-page.php:455
msgid "Available"
msgstr "Disponible"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:449
msgid "Redis detected but password-protected — set WP_REDIS_PASSWORD in wp-config.php."
msgstr "Redis detectado pero protegido con contraseña — define WP_REDIS_PASSWORD en wp-config.php."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:449
msgid "Redis server detected, but the phpredis extension is not installed — selecting this would cache nothing."
msgstr "Servidor Redis detectado, pero la extensión phpredis no está instalada — seleccionarlo no cachearía nada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:449
msgid "Redis is configured but not answering — start the service or check WP_REDIS_HOST / WP_REDIS_PORT."
msgstr "Redis está configurado pero no responde — arranca el servicio o revisa WP_REDIS_HOST / WP_REDIS_PORT."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:449
msgid "Not available on this server — selecting this would cache nothing."
msgstr "No disponible en este servidor — seleccionarlo no cachearía nada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:450
msgid "In-memory key lookup, no disk I/O: faster under concurrency and better at indexing than disk. Reuses your WP_REDIS_* settings. Requires the Redis service and the phpredis extension."
msgstr "Búsqueda de claves en memoria, sin E/S de disco: más rápido con concurrencia y mejor en el indexado que el disco. Reutiliza tu configuración WP_REDIS_*. Requiere el servicio Redis y la extensión phpredis."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:454
msgid "Memcached"
msgstr "Memcached"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:455
msgid "Memcached server detected, but the PHP extension is not installed — selecting this would cache nothing."
msgstr "Servidor Memcached detectado, pero la extensión PHP no está instalada — seleccionarlo no cachearía nada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:455
msgid "Not available here — needs the Memcached PHP extension and a running server; selecting it would cache nothing."
msgstr "No disponible aquí — requiere la extensión PHP Memcached y un servidor en marcha; seleccionarlo no cachearía nada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:456
msgid "Same in-memory advantage as Redis; its flush is generation-based so it never wipes a store shared with the object cache. Requires the Memcached service and extension."
msgstr "La misma ventaja en memoria que Redis; su flush se basa en generaciones, así que nunca borra un almacén compartido con el object cache. Requiere el servicio Memcached y la extensión."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:459
msgid "Change the backend, then toggle the Page Cache off and on from the card above to apply it."
msgstr "Cambia el backend y luego desactiva y vuelve a activar la Page Cache desde la tarjeta de arriba para aplicarlo."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:463
msgid "Page cache TTL"
msgstr "TTL de la page cache"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:466
msgid "seconds. Default: 300. It is only a fallback for edge misses, so a short value is fine; a purge clears it anyway."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 300. Solo es una red de seguridad para los miss del edge, así que un valor corto está bien; una purga la limpia de todos modos."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:471
msgid "Object cache (protects logged-in users and wp-admin)"
msgstr "Object cache (protege a usuarios logueados y wp-admin)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:475
msgid "Page cache only covers anonymous visitors. Your editors, and every wp-admin and admin-ajax request, bypass it and hit the database directly. A persistent object cache (Redis or Memcached) absorbs that load. Without one, a busy newsroom can overwhelm MySQL even with page cache on."
msgstr "La page cache solo cubre a las visitas anónimas. Tu redacción, y cada petición de wp-admin y admin-ajax, la saltan y pegan directamente a la base de datos. Un object cache persistente (Redis o Memcached) absorbe esa carga. Sin él, una redacción intensa puede saturar MySQL incluso con la page cache activada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:479
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Automático"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:483
msgid "Enable the object cache automatically when a live memory backend (Redis or Memcached) is detected"
msgstr "Activar el object cache automáticamente cuando se detecte un backend de memoria vivo (Redis o Memcached)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:485
msgid "Recommended. When off, you must enable the object cache by hand from the card at the top. It never overwrites an object-cache.php from another plugin without your confirmation."
msgstr "Recomendado. Si está desactivado, debes activar el object cache a mano desde la tarjeta de arriba. Nunca sobrescribe un object-cache.php de otro plugin sin tu confirmación."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:490
msgid "Static Resources (CSS, JS, images, fonts, video)"
msgstr "Recursos Estáticos (CSS, JS, imágenes, fuentes, vídeo)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:494
msgid "Static files are served by the web server, not PHP. On Apache/LiteSpeed the plugin writes these TTLs into .htaccess; on nginx they only apply once the snippet below is installed by hand. The check below shows what browsers really receive. When assets change (media uploads, theme/plugin updates), the plugin invalidates them automatically."
msgstr "Los ficheros estáticos los sirve el servidor web, no PHP. En Apache/LiteSpeed el plugin escribe estos TTL en .htaccess; en nginx solo se aplican cuando se instala a mano el fragmento de abajo. La comprobación de abajo muestra lo que reciben de verdad los navegadores. Cuando cambian los recursos (subidas de medios, actualizaciones de tema o plugins), el plugin los invalida automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:501
msgid "seconds. Default: 2592000 (30 days)."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 2592000 (30 días)."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:508
msgid "seconds. Default: 86400 (1 day)."
msgstr "segundos. Por defecto: 86400 (1 día)."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:515
msgid "Server:"
msgstr "Servidor:"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:529
msgid "What browsers receive:"
msgstr "Lo que reciben los navegadores:"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:531
msgid "not checked yet."
msgstr "aún sin comprobar."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:537
#, php-format
msgid "✓ max-age=%1$d (expected %2$d)."
msgstr "✓ max-age=%1$d (esperado %2$d)."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:539
#, php-format
msgid "⚠ max-age=%1$d, lower than the %2$d expected — another layer is setting it."
msgstr "⚠ max-age=%1$d, menor que el %2$d esperado — lo está fijando otra capa."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:540
msgid "✗ no max-age: browsers do not cache static files. The rules are not being applied — install the snippet for your server or the VCL below."
msgstr "✗ sin max-age: los navegadores no guardan los ficheros estáticos. Las reglas no se están aplicando — instala el fragmento para tu servidor o el VCL de abajo."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:542
#, php-format
msgid "⚠ could not check (%s)."
msgstr "⚠ no se pudo comprobar (%s)."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:549
msgid "Check now"
msgstr "Comprobar ahora"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:551
msgid "Checked by requesting one of the plugin's own files through the CDN, as a visitor would. Files the plugin generates (minified/combined CSS and JS) are named after their content, so they are served for a year as immutable, whatever the Browser TTL above."
msgstr "Se comprueba pidiendo uno de los ficheros del propio plugin a través de la CDN, como lo haría un visitante. Los ficheros que genera el plugin (CSS y JS minificados/combinados) llevan su contenido en el nombre, así que se sirven durante un año como inmutables, sea cual sea el TTL de navegador de arriba."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:556
msgid "Nginx config snippet (add to your server {} block)"
msgstr "Snippet Nginx (añadir al bloque server {})"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:561 includes/admin/views/main-page.php:573
msgid "📋 Copy"
msgstr "📋 Copiar"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:568
msgid "Transparent Edge VCL snippet (applies the TTLs at the edge when the origin sends none)"
msgstr "Fragmento VCL de Transparent Edge (aplica los TTL en el edge cuando el origen no envía ninguno)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:579
msgid "Static asset invalidation is automatic: media uploads, theme and plugin updates trigger Varnish purge. WordPress version strings (?ver=X) on CSS/JS handle browser cache-busting."
msgstr "La invalidación de recursos estáticos es automática: la subida de media y las actualizaciones de temas y plugins disparan la purga en Varnish. Las versiones de WordPress (?ver=X) en CSS/JS gestionan la renovación en el navegador."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:585
msgid "Cache Variants"
msgstr "Variantes de Caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:588
msgid "Surrogate-Keys"
msgstr "Surrogate-Keys"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:589
msgid "Tag every page with content identifiers for surgical cache invalidation"
msgstr "Etiquetar cada página con identificadores de contenido para invalidación quirúrgica"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:592
msgid "Vary by Device"
msgstr "Variar por Dispositivo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:593
msgid "Separate cache for mobile and desktop (uses X-Device header)"
msgstr "Caché separada para móvil y escritorio (usa cabecera X-Device)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:596
msgid "Vary by Language"
msgstr "Variar por Idioma"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:597
msgid "Separate cache per language (enable if using WPML/Polylang)"
msgstr "Caché separada por idioma (activar si usa WPML/Polylang)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:604
msgid "Cache Invalidation"
msgstr "Invalidación de Caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:605
msgid "Configure when and how cached content is automatically purged from the CDN."
msgstr "Configura cuándo y cómo se purga automáticamente el contenido cacheado del CDN."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:609
msgid "Auto-invalidation"
msgstr "Auto-invalidación"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:610
msgid "Automatically purge cache when content changes"
msgstr "Purgar automáticamente la caché cuando cambia el contenido"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:613
msgid "Invalidation Method"
msgstr "Método de Invalidación"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:616
msgid "Soft Purge (recommended — serves stale if origin fails)"
msgstr "Soft Purge (recomendado — sirve contenido antiguo si el origen falla)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:617
msgid "Hard Purge (immediately removes from cache)"
msgstr "Hard Purge (elimina inmediatamente de la caché)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:622
msgid "Refetch after purge"
msgstr "Refetch tras purga"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:623
msgid "Warm up cache immediately after invalidation (no cold MISSes)"
msgstr "Precalentar caché inmediatamente tras invalidación (sin MISSes en frío)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:626
msgid "Warm method"
msgstr "Método de warm-up"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:629
msgid "Platform refetch (recommended — warms every edge node, origin-safe)"
msgstr "Refetch de plataforma (recomendado — calienta todos los nodos, seguro para el origen)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:630
msgid "Origin GET (fallback — only warms one node)"
msgstr "GET al origen (fallback — solo calienta un nodo)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:632
msgid "Refetch re-warms the changed URLs on the whole edge in one call; the platform refetchers aggregate the origin fetches, so your origin sees one or two requests instead of one per node. It needs no MidTier. The origin GET is used automatically as a fallback when the API is unavailable."
msgstr "El refetch recalienta las URLs cambiadas en todo el edge con una sola llamada; los nodos refetcher de la plataforma agregan las peticiones al origen, así que tu origen ve una o dos en vez de una por nodo. No necesita MidTier. El GET al origen se usa automáticamente como fallback cuando la API no está disponible."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:636
msgid "Purge triggers"
msgstr "Disparadores de purga"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:639
msgid "Posts & Pages"
msgstr "Posts y Páginas"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:640
msgid "Purge when a post, page, or CPT is published, updated, or deleted"
msgstr "Purgar cuando un post, página o CPT se publica, actualiza o elimina"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:641
msgid "Publishing refreshes the post itself and the pages that list it: home, its sections and tags, its author page and feeds. Other posts are not touched."
msgstr "Al publicar se refresca el propio post y las páginas que lo listan: portada, sus secciones y etiquetas, la página de su autor y los feeds. Los demás posts no se tocan."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:644
msgid "\"Latest\" blocks in posts"
msgstr "Bloques de «últimas» en los posts"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:645
msgid "Also refresh every post of the same type when one is published"
msgstr "Refrescar también todos los posts del mismo tipo al publicar uno"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:646
msgid "Only if your theme shows a \"latest news\" or similar block inside each post and it must update right away. On a large site this revalidates every post on each publish, which adds origin load — leave it off unless you need it."
msgstr "Solo si tu tema muestra un bloque de «últimas noticias» o similar dentro de cada post y debe actualizarse al momento. En un sitio grande esto revalida todos los posts en cada publicación, lo que añade carga al origen — déjalo desactivado salvo que lo necesites."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:649
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "Comentarios"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:650
msgid "Purge when a new comment is approved or edited"
msgstr "Purgar cuando un nuevo comentario es aprobado o editado"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:653
msgid "Menus"
msgstr "Menús"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:654
msgid "Purge when a navigation menu is updated"
msgstr "Purgar cuando un menú de navegación se actualiza"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:657
msgid "Widgets"
msgstr "Widgets"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:658
msgid "Purge when sidebar widgets are updated"
msgstr "Purgar cuando los widgets de la barra lateral se actualizan"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:661
msgid "Theme Switch"
msgstr "Cambio de Tema"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:662
msgid "Full purge when the active theme is changed"
msgstr "Purga completa cuando se cambia el tema activo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:665
msgid "Plugin Changes"
msgstr "Cambios de Plugins"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:666
msgid "Full purge when any plugin is activated or deactivated"
msgstr "Purga completa cuando se activa o desactiva cualquier plugin"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:669
msgid "Cache warming"
msgstr "Calentamiento de caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:672
msgid "Preload via Sitemap"
msgstr "Precargar vía Sitemap"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:674
msgid "Crawl the sitemap after a full purge to warm the CDN cache (no cold MISSes)"
msgstr "Recorre el sitemap tras una purga total para calentar la caché de CDN (sin MISSes en frío)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:675
msgid "A bulk warm of the whole site. It is throttled and gated so it never overloads the origin — see the controls below."
msgstr "Un calentamiento masivo de todo el sitio. Está limitado y controlado para no sobrecargar nunca el origen — mira los controles de abajo."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:679
msgid "Preload method"
msgstr "Método de preload"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:682
msgid "Refetch (recommended — origin-aggregated, safe for weak origins)"
msgstr "Refetch (recomendado — agregado en origen, seguro para orígenes débiles)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:683
msgid "Prefetch (populates without evicting, but fans out ~1 fetch per node — strong origins only)"
msgstr "Prefetch (puebla sin invalidar, pero hace fan-out de ~1 petición por nodo — solo orígenes fuertes)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:685
msgid "Refetch collapses the origin fetches through the refetcher nodes (origin sees one or two per URL). Prefetch warms every node directly, so each node fetches from the origin — only choose it if your origin can take one request per edge node per URL."
msgstr "El refetch colapsa las peticiones al origen a través de los nodos refetcher (el origen ve una o dos por URL). El prefetch calienta cada nodo directamente, así que cada nodo pega al origen — elígelo solo si tu origen aguanta una petición por nodo de edge y URL."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:689
msgid "Adaptive pacing"
msgstr "Ritmo adaptativo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:691
msgid "Auto-tune the warm-up speed to what the origin can take"
msgstr "Auto-ajusta la velocidad del calentado a lo que el origen aguanta"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:692
msgid "Ramps the batch size up while the origin keeps up (its latency stays near its own baseline) and the page-cache disk has headroom, and cuts it back when the origin starts to slow, the platform rate-limits, or the disk runs low. It tunes to the origin's real capacity whatever its speed. The guardrails (health gate, backoff, off-peak) are unchanged — this only moves within them. Ideal for sites with thousands of URLs."
msgstr "Sube el tamaño de lote mientras el origen aguanta (su latencia se mantiene cerca de su propia línea base) y la page cache tiene hueco de disco, y lo recorta cuando el origen empieza a ir lento, la plataforma hace rate-limit o el disco se queda sin espacio. Se ajusta a la capacidad real del origen sea cual sea su velocidad. Los guardarraíles (control de salud, backoff, off-peak) no cambian — esto solo se mueve dentro de ellos. Ideal para sitios con miles de URLs."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:696
msgid "Origin health gate"
msgstr "Control de salud del origen"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:698
msgid "Probe the origin before each batch and pause the preload if it is slow or erroring"
msgstr "Sondea el origen antes de cada lote y pausa el preload si va lento o da errores"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:699
msgid "This toggle governs the manual preload. The automatic preload after a full purge is always gated, whatever this is set to, so a scheduled warm never overloads the origin unattended."
msgstr "Este interruptor controla el preload manual. El preload automático tras una purga total va siempre protegido, esté como esté esto, para que un calentamiento programado nunca sobrecargue el origen sin supervisión."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:703
msgid "Off-peak only"
msgstr "Solo en horas valle"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:705
msgid "Run the bulk preload only during an off-peak window"
msgstr "Ejecuta el preload masivo solo durante una ventana de horas valle"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:707
msgid "Window (site time, 24h):"
msgstr "Ventana (hora del sitio, 24h):"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:720
