msgstr "1. Copia el snippet anterior. 2. Ve a %s. 3. Añade el snippet a tu configuración VCL. 4. Despliega."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:782
msgid "Frontend Optimization"
msgstr "Optimización Frontend"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:783
msgid "Optimize Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) by controlling how assets are loaded, minified, and served."
msgstr "Optimiza los Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) controlando cómo se cargan, minifican y sirven los recursos."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:787
msgid "CSS"
msgstr "CSS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:790
msgid "Minify CSS"
msgstr "Minificar CSS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:793
msgid "Minify CSS files (removes comments, whitespace). Cached to disk."
msgstr "Minificar archivos CSS (elimina comentarios, espacios). Caché en disco."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:794
msgid "Already-minified files (.min.css) and external CSS are skipped."
msgstr "Los archivos ya minificados (.min.css) y CSS externos se omiten."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:798
msgid "Combine CSS"
msgstr "Combinar CSS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:801
msgid "Combine local CSS files into a single file (reduces HTTP requests)"
msgstr "Combinar archivos CSS locales en un solo archivo (reduce peticiones HTTP)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:802
msgid "Concatenates all local stylesheets into one file. External and conditional CSS are preserved. Includes minification automatically."
msgstr "Concatena todas las hojas de estilo locales en un archivo. CSS externo y condicional se preservan. Incluye minificación automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:806
msgid "Remove Unused CSS"
msgstr "Eliminar CSS no usado"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:809
msgid "Serve only the CSS each page actually uses (major LCP improvement)"
msgstr "Servir solo el CSS que cada página usa realmente (gran mejora de LCP)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:810
msgid "Used CSS is generated in the background per template and served inline; the rest is deferred. Generation never blocks visitors, and if it fails the original CSS is served unchanged."
msgstr "El CSS usado se genera en segundo plano por plantilla y se sirve inline; el resto se difiere. La generación nunca bloquea a los visitantes, y si falla se sirve el CSS original sin cambios."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:812
msgid "Exclusions (one handle or URL fragment per line):"
msgstr "Exclusiones (un handle o fragmento de URL por línea):"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:819
msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:822
msgid "Minify JS"
msgstr "Minificar JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:825
msgid "Minify JS files (removes comments, extra whitespace). Cached to disk."
msgstr "Minificar archivos JS (elimina comentarios, espacios extra). Caché en disco."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:826
msgid "Already-minified files (.min.js), jQuery, and external scripts are skipped. Conservative approach to avoid breaking JS."
msgstr "Los archivos ya minificados (.min.js), jQuery y scripts externos se omiten. Enfoque conservador para no romper JS."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:830
msgid "Combine JS"
msgstr "Combinar JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:833
msgid "Combine local JS files into a single file (reduces HTTP requests)"
msgstr "Combinar archivos JS locales en un solo archivo (reduce peticiones HTTP)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:834
msgid "Only footer scripts are combined. jQuery, WP core, and external scripts stay separate. Includes minification automatically."
msgstr "Solo se combinan scripts del footer. jQuery, core WP y scripts externos se mantienen separados. Incluye minificación automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:838
msgid "Combine JS Exclusions"
msgstr "Exclusiones de Combinar JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:841
msgid "One handle or pattern per line. Scripts matching these will NOT be combined."
msgstr "Un handle o patrón por línea. Los scripts que coincidan NO se combinarán."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:848
msgid "Add defer attribute to JS files (load without blocking HTML parsing)"
msgstr "Añadir atributo defer a archivos JS (carga sin bloquear el parseo HTML)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:849
msgid "Improves LCP. jQuery and core WP scripts are excluded automatically."
msgstr "Mejora LCP. jQuery y los scripts core de WP se excluyen automáticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:853
msgid "Defer JS Exclusions"
msgstr "Exclusiones de Defer JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:856
msgid "One handle or pattern per line. Scripts matching these will NOT get defer."
msgstr "Un handle o patrón por línea. Los scripts que coincidan NO tendrán defer."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:860
msgid "Delay JS Execution"
msgstr "Ejecución Retardada de JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:863
msgid "Delay non-critical JavaScript until user interaction (mouse, scroll, touch)"
msgstr "Retrasar JavaScript no crítico hasta la interacción del usuario (ratón, scroll, toque)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:864
msgid "More aggressive than defer — scripts don't load at all until user interacts. Best for INP."
msgstr "Más agresivo que defer — los scripts no se cargan en absoluto hasta que el usuario interactúa. Ideal para INP."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:868
msgid "Delay JS Exclusions"
msgstr "Exclusiones de Delay JS"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:871
msgid "One pattern per line. jQuery is always excluded. A pattern matches anywhere in the whole <script> tag — its attributes (src, id) and, for inline scripts, its code — not only the src. A script injected at runtime by another script (e.g. gtm.js loaded by the GTM snippet) never appears in the HTML: write a pattern that matches the snippet that loads it. Excluded scripts are also kept out of the combined JS bundle."
msgstr "Un patrón por línea. jQuery siempre se excluye. Un patrón coincide en cualquier parte de la etiqueta <script> completa — sus atributos (src, id) y, en los scripts inline, su código —, no solo en el src. Un script que otro script inyecta al cargar (p. ej. gtm.js, cargado por el snippet de GTM) nunca aparece en el HTML: escribe un patrón que coincida con el snippet que lo carga. Los scripts excluidos también se quedan fuera del bundle JS combinado."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:875
msgid "Always Delay"
msgstr "Aplazar siempre"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:878
msgid "One pattern per line, matched the same way as the exclusions. Small inline scripts (under 500 bytes) are not delayed by default; list here the loader snippets you want delayed anyway — Google Tag Manager, Microsoft Clarity, Hotjar, Meta Pixel… Exclusions take precedence."
msgstr "Un patrón por línea, con la misma regla de coincidencia que las exclusiones. Los scripts inline pequeños (menos de 500 bytes) no se aplazan por defecto; pon aquí los snippets cargadores que quieras aplazar igualmente — Google Tag Manager, Microsoft Clarity, Hotjar, Meta Pixel… Las exclusiones tienen prioridad."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:883
msgid "Images & Media"
msgstr "Imágenes y Media"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:889
msgid "Add loading=\"lazy\" to below-the-fold images"
msgstr "Añadir loading=\"lazy\" a imágenes fuera del viewport"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:896
msgid "Add loading=\"lazy\" to iframes (YouTube, Google Maps, etc.)"
msgstr "Añadir loading=\"lazy\" a iframes (YouTube, Google Maps, etc.)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:900
msgid "Lazy Load Background Images"
msgstr "Lazy Load de imágenes de fondo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:903
msgid "Defer CSS background images (inline style) until they approach the viewport"
msgstr "Diferir imágenes de fondo CSS (estilo inline) hasta que se acerquen al viewport"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:904
msgid "The first two background images are kept eager to protect LCP. Add data-no-lazy to opt an element out."
msgstr "Las dos primeras imágenes de fondo se mantienen activas para proteger el LCP. Añade data-no-lazy para excluir un elemento."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:908
msgid "Preload LCP Image"
msgstr "Precargar Imagen LCP"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:911
msgid "Detect the first image and add a preload hint in <head> for faster LCP"
msgstr "Detectar la primera imagen y añadir un hint de precarga en <head> para un LCP más rápido"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:916
msgid "HTML"
msgstr "HTML"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:919
msgid "Minify HTML"
msgstr "Minificar HTML"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:922
msgid "Remove comments, extra whitespace, and blank lines from HTML"
msgstr "Eliminar comentarios, espacios extra y líneas en blanco del HTML"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:927
msgid "Fonts & Network"
msgstr "Fuentes y Red"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:933
msgid "Download Google Fonts and serve them locally (better TTFB + GDPR)"
msgstr "Descargar Google Fonts y servirlas localmente (mejor TTFB + GDPR)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:934
msgid "Eliminates DNS lookup to fonts.googleapis.com and fonts.gstatic.com. Fonts are cached in wp-content/cache/."
msgstr "Elimina la resolución DNS a fonts.googleapis.com y fonts.gstatic.com. Las fuentes se cachean en wp-content/cache/."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:938
msgid "Additional DNS Prefetch"
msgstr "DNS Prefetch Adicional"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:946
msgid "Auto-detected:"
msgstr "Auto-detectados:"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:950
msgid "excluded"
msgstr "excluido"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:953
msgid "These domains are prefetched automatically based on your active plugins. No action needed."
msgstr "Estos dominios se precargan automáticamente según tus plugins activos. No requiere acción."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:957
msgid "Add any third-party origins not detected above (one per line). DNS is resolved and connections are opened before the browser needs them."
msgstr "Añade orígenes de terceros no detectados arriba (uno por línea). El DNS se resuelve y las conexiones se abren antes de que el navegador las necesite."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:961
msgid "Exclude Auto-detected"
msgstr "Excluir autodetectados"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:964
msgid "Auto-detected hosts that should get no dns-prefetch/preconnect hint (one per line) — for example a service your theme loads only after interaction."
msgstr "Hosts autodetectados que no deben recibir pista dns-prefetch/preconnect (uno por línea) — por ejemplo, un servicio que tu tema carga solo tras la interacción."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:975
msgid "Accelerate page-to-page navigation by telling the browser to prefetch or prerender links before the user clicks."
msgstr "Acelera la navegación entre páginas indicando al navegador que haga prefetch o prerender de enlaces antes de que el usuario haga clic."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:988
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Configuración Avanzada"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:992
msgid "Excluded URLs"
msgstr "URLs Excluidas"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:995
msgid "One pattern per line. Regex supported. These URLs will never be cached."
msgstr "Un patrón por línea. Soporta regex. Estas URLs nunca se cachearán."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:999
msgid "Excluded Cookies"
msgstr "Cookies Excluidas"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1002
msgid "One pattern per line. If a visitor has any of these cookies, the page won't be cached."
msgstr "Un patrón por línea. Si un visitante tiene alguna de estas cookies, la página no se cacheará."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1006
msgid "Cookie normalisation"
msgstr "Normalización de cookies"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1008
msgid "A stray analytics or consent cookie can push the edge to pass every anonymous request to the origin. These tools keep that from happening."
msgstr "Una cookie de analítica o de consentimiento perdida puede hacer que el edge mande al origen todas las peticiones anónimas. Estas herramientas lo evitan."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1010 includes/admin/TE_Admin.php:117
msgid "Check cookies now"
msgstr "Comprobar cookies ahora"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1015
msgid "Cookie-strip VCL snippet (propose-only — review before deploying)"
msgstr "Snippet VCL de limpieza de cookies (solo propuesta — revísalo antes de desplegar)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1016
msgid "Keeps only the Excluded Cookies above and strips the rest before the cache lookup, so a stray cookie no longer causes a miss. The plugin never deploys VCL — copy it into Configuration → VCL on the Transparent Edge dashboard."
msgstr "Mantiene solo las Cookies excluidas de arriba y elimina el resto antes de la búsqueda en caché, para que una cookie perdida ya no provoque un miss. El plugin nunca despliega VCL — cópialo en Configuration → VCL del panel de Transparent Edge."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1024
msgid "Ignored Query Strings"
msgstr "Query Strings Ignorados"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1027
msgid "One per line. These query parameters (UTM, fbclid, etc.) are stripped from the cache key."
msgstr "Uno por línea. Estos parámetros de consulta (UTM, fbclid, etc.) se eliminan de la clave de caché."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1032
msgid "VCL Snippet for Query String Stripping (deploy in TE dashboard)"
msgstr "Snippet VCL para Eliminación de Query Strings (desplegar en dashboard TE)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1047
msgid "Normalize Query Strings"
msgstr "Normalizar parámetros de URL"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1049
msgid "Serve cached pages for unknown query strings (keep only the allowlisted parameters in the cache key)"
msgstr "Servir páginas cacheadas para parámetros desconocidos (en la clave de caché solo se conservan los parámetros permitidos)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1050
msgid "OFF by default. When on, a URL with an unrecognised parameter (e.g. ?ref=x, ?zz=1) is served from cache instead of forcing a full page render — this closes a cache-busting load vector. Only enable it where every parameter that changes the page is in the allowlist below; NOT safe on sites with WooCommerce filters, faceted search or custom query-based content."
msgstr "DESACTIVADO por defecto. Activado, una URL con un parámetro no reconocido (p. ej. ?ref=x, ?zz=1) se sirve desde caché en lugar de forzar un render completo de la página — cierra una vía de carga por saltarse la caché. Actívalo solo si todos los parámetros que cambian la página están en la lista de abajo; NO es seguro en sitios con filtros de WooCommerce, búsqueda facetada o contenido basado en parámetros."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1054
msgid "Content Query Strings (allowlist)"
msgstr "Parámetros de contenido (lista permitida)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1057
msgid "One per line. Only used when “Normalize Query Strings” is on. WordPress core content parameters (p, page_id, paged, cat, tag, author…) are already included — add here any extra parameter that genuinely changes the page and must keep its own cache entry. Search (?s=) is not cached: it bypasses automatically so it never collapses onto the clean URL."
msgstr "Uno por línea. Solo se usa con «Normalizar parámetros de URL» activado. Los parámetros de contenido del núcleo de WordPress (p, page_id, paged, cat, tag, author…) ya están incluidos — añade aquí cualquier otro parámetro que cambie de verdad la página y deba tener su propia entrada de caché. La búsqueda (?s=) no se cachea: se salta automáticamente para no acabar en la URL limpia."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1062
msgid "Content-negotiation Variant Header"
msgstr "Cabecera de variante por negociación de contenido"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1065
msgid "Optional. Name of an edge-set request header (value \"1\") that selects an alternate cached representation of the SAME URL - e.g. a Markdown version for AI agents. Leave empty to disable. The stored page is kept under its own key, so it never collides with the HTML one."
msgstr "Opcional. Nombre de una cabecera de petición que pone el edge (valor \"1\") y que selecciona una representación alternativa cacheada de la MISMA URL — p. ej. una versión en Markdown para agentes de IA. Déjalo vacío para desactivarlo. La página guardada va con su propia clave, así que nunca choca con la HTML."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1066
msgid "Requirement:"
msgstr "Requisito:"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1066
msgid "the edge MUST unset this header on the incoming request and set it itself from its own content negotiation; otherwise a client could choose its own variant."
msgstr "el edge DEBE eliminar esta cabecera de la petición entrante y ponerla él mismo según su propia negociación de contenido; si no, un cliente podría elegir su propia variante."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1072
msgid "WooCommerce"
msgstr "WooCommerce"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1075
msgid "Exclude from cache"
msgstr "Excluir de la caché"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1077
msgid "Cart page"
msgstr "Página del carrito"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1078
msgid "Checkout page"
msgstr "Página de pago"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1079
msgid "My Account page"
msgstr "Página de Mi Cuenta"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1083
msgid "Stock changes"
msgstr "Cambios de Stock"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1084
msgid "Purge product page when stock changes"
msgstr "Purgar página del producto cuando cambia el stock"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1089
msgid "Heartbeat Control"
msgstr "Control del Heartbeat"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1092
msgid "Heartbeat Behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento del Heartbeat"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1095
msgid "Default (WordPress controls it)"
msgstr "Por defecto (WordPress lo controla)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1096
msgid "Reduce frequency (recommended)"
msgstr "Reducir frecuencia (recomendado)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1097
msgid "Disable everywhere (saves max resources)"
msgstr "Desactivar en todas partes (ahorra máximos recursos)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1099
msgid "The Heartbeat API sends AJAX requests every 15-60s for autosave, post locking, etc. Reducing it saves server resources."
msgstr "La API Heartbeat envía peticiones AJAX cada 15-60s para autoguardado, bloqueo de posts, etc. Reducirla ahorra recursos del servidor."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1103
msgid "Heartbeat Interval"
msgstr "Intervalo del Heartbeat"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1106
msgid "seconds (15-120). Default WP: 15-60. Recommended: 60 or 120."
msgstr "segundos (15-120). WP por defecto: 15-60. Recomendado: 60 o 120."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1110
msgid "Disable in Admin"
msgstr "Desactivar en Admin"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1113
msgid "Disable Heartbeat in the admin dashboard (except post editor)"
msgstr "Desactivar Heartbeat en el panel de administración (excepto editor de posts)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1117
msgid "Disable in Post Editor"
msgstr "Desactivar en Editor de Posts"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1120
msgid "Disable Heartbeat in the post editor (warning: disables autosave)"
msgstr "Desactivar Heartbeat en el editor de posts (aviso: desactiva el autoguardado)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1121
msgid "Use with caution. Without autosave, unsaved work is lost if the browser crashes."
msgstr "Usa con precaución. Sin autoguardado, el trabajo no guardado se pierde si el navegador se cierra inesperadamente."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1126
msgid "Editorial write load (revisions &amp; autosave)"
msgstr "Carga de escritura de redacción (revisiones y autosave)"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1130
msgid "Every autosave tick and every stored revision is a database write on the logged-in path, which no cache can absorb. On an editor-heavy site this adds up. These controls are optional and change nothing until enabled."
msgstr "Cada autosave y cada revisión guardada es una escritura en la base de datos en la ruta de logueados, que ninguna caché absorbe. En un sitio con mucha redacción, suma. Estos controles son opcionales y no cambian nada hasta activarlos."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1137
msgid "Apply the revision and autosave limits below"
msgstr "Aplicar los límites de revisiones y autosave de abajo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1141
msgid "Revisions to keep"
msgstr "Revisiones a conservar"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1144
msgid "-1 = leave WordPress alone (default). 0 = disable revisions. A positive number keeps that many per post."
msgstr "-1 = no tocar WordPress (por defecto). 0 = desactivar revisiones. Un número positivo conserva esa cantidad por entrada."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1148
msgid "Autosave interval"
msgstr "Intervalo de autosave"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1151
msgid "seconds. 0 = leave WordPress default (60s). Otherwise clamped to 60-600. Ignored if AUTOSAVE_INTERVAL is set in wp-config.php."
msgstr "segundos. 0 = dejar el valor por defecto de WordPress (60s). Si no, se limita a 60-600. Se ignora si AUTOSAVE_INTERVAL está definido en wp-config.php."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1156
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Depuración"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1159
msgid "Debug Mode"
msgstr "Modo Depuración"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1160
msgid "Add debug headers (X-Flavor-Edge-Keys, X-Flavor-Edge-TTL) to responses"
msgstr "Añadir cabeceras de depuración (X-Flavor-Edge-Keys, X-Flavor-Edge-TTL) a las respuestas"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1168
msgid "The latest purges this site sent to Transparent Edge: what triggered each one, what was purged and the result. Bulk preload batches are listed only when they fail."
msgstr "Las últimas purgas que este sitio ha enviado a Transparent Edge: qué disparó cada una, qué se purgó y el resultado. Los lotes del precalentamiento masivo solo aparecen cuando fallan."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1174
msgid "No purges recorded yet."
msgstr "Aún no hay purgas registradas."

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1179
msgid "Date"
msgstr "Fecha"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1180
msgid "Triggered by"
msgstr "Origen"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1181
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Tipo"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1182
msgid "Purged"
msgstr "Purgado"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1183
msgid "Result"
msgstr "Resultado"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1184
msgid "User"
msgstr "Usuario"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1206
msgid "tags"
msgstr "etiquetas"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1207
msgid "URLs"
msgstr "URLs"

#: includes/admin/views/main-page.php:1208
msgid "ban"
msgstr "ban"

